{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","疾风吟响"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","疾風の唄"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤风暴，对风暴内的敌人持续造成伤害并降低急速。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","持続的に暴風を召喚し、暴風内の敵にダメージを与え、速度をDOWNさせる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择最靠前的1名敌人持续施法，在其所在位置及周围2格生成持续5秒的风暴，风暴范围内的敌人降低30 + 3点急速，并每0.5秒受到洛桑50% + 6% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","最も前にいる敵1体を選択し、5秒間、スキルを発動し続ける。期間中、対象の位置とその周囲2マス範囲内に暴風を発生させ、範囲内の敵は速度-30 + 3、0.5秒ごとにクインの50% + 6% ATKのダメージを受ける"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":48,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":69,"end":74,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":69,"end":73,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":88,"end":93,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":2,"end":5,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"},{"start":66,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":0,"end":6,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"},{"start":85,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次对敌人造成的伤害提升至55% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","1回ごとのダメージが55% + 6% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次对敌人造成的伤害提升至60% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","1回ごとのダメージが60% + 6% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次对敌人造成的伤害提升至65% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","1回ごとのダメージが65% + 6% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","每次对敌人造成的伤害提升至70% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","1回ごとのダメージが70% + 6% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","引风链"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","風繋ぎ"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始后，用“风链”连接最近和最远的敌人，传递伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始後、「風の鎖」で最も近い敵と最も遠い敵を繋げ、ダメージを拡散させる"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始后，用“风链”连接距离自己最近和最远的各一名敌方英雄，其中一方受到伤害时，会使另一方也承受本次伤害量的70% + 10%（每名敌人每秒通过该技能受到的伤害不超过洛桑攻击力的500%，且该伤害无法击败敌人）。当这两名敌人通过该技能受到的伤害总和达到洛桑初始攻击力的900%，或其中一名敌人被击败时，“风链”断开。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始後、「風の鎖」で自身から最も近い敵英雄1体と最も遠い敵英雄1体を繋げ、その片方がダメージを受けた時、もう片方の敵も70% + 10%分のダメージを受ける（1体の敵が毎秒、このスキルによって受けるダメージはクインの攻撃力の500%を超えない。このダメージによって敵は撃破されることはない）。繋がれた2体の敵が受けた、このスキルによる合計ダメージがクインの初期攻撃力の900%に達した場合、または2体の敵のいずれかが撃破された場合、「風の鎖」は解除される"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":64,"end":70,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","另一名敌人受到的伤害提升至伤害量的80% + 10%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","もう片方の敵が受けるダメージが80% + 10%にUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","另一名敌人受到的伤害提升至伤害量的90% + 10%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","もう片方の敵が受けるダメージが90% + 10%にUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","另一名敌人受到的伤害提升至伤害量的100% + 10%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","もう片方の敵が受けるダメージが100% + 10%にUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","风愈之护"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","風の守り"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","为最虚弱的友军持续回复生命值，并提高闪避率和急速。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","最も弱っている味方の回避率と速度UP、HPが持続的に回復"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","为最虚弱的友军施加持续6秒的“风愈之护”，在此期间，该友军获得50闪避率和30 + 3点急速，并且每秒回复-90% − 12% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","6秒間、最も弱っている味方に「風の守り」を付与。「風の守り」の持続期間中、対象味方の回避率+50、速度+30 + 3、毎秒HPを-90% − 12% ATK回復"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":57,"end":63,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":54,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":68,"end":74,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":1,"end":5,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":33,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"keyword:dodg"},{"start":53,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":4,"end":11,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":42,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"keyword:dodg"},{"start":64,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每秒的生命回复量提升至-100% − 12% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","毎秒のHP回復量が-100% − 12% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每秒的生命回复量提升至-110% − 12% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","毎秒のHP回復量が-110% − 12% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每秒的生命回复量提升至-120% − 12% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","毎秒のHP回復量が-120% − 12% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击，风链断开后额外提升自身攻击。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の攻撃力UP。「風の鎖」が初めて解除された後、追加で自身の攻撃力UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升9%，风链首次断开后额外提升6%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+9%。「風の鎖」が初めて解除された後、追加で攻撃力+6%"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%，风链首次断开后额外提升8%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+12%。「風の鎖」が初めて解除された後、追加で攻撃力+8%"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升15%，风链首次断开后额外提升10%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+15%。「風の鎖」が初めて解除された後、追加で攻撃力+10%"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","迎风脉息"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","風の脈動"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“风链”断开时，治疗全体友军并再次释放“风链”。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","「風の鎖」が解除された時、味方全体を回復し、再び「風の鎖」を発動"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“风链”断开时，使所有友军回复200% ATK的生命值，并再次释放“风链”。每场战斗最多释放3次风链。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「風の鎖」が解除された時、味方全体のHPを200% ATK回復し、再び「風の鎖」を発動。1度の戦闘につき、「風の鎖」を3回まで発動可能"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“风链”断开时回复的生命值提升至300% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「風の鎖」が解除された時のHP回復量が300% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“风链”断开时，使原本被链接的2名敌人晕眩5秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「風の鎖」が解除された時、繋がれていた2体の敵に5秒間のスタンを付与"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“风链”断开时回复的生命值提升至400% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","「風の鎖」が解除された時のHP回復量が400% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“风愈之护”还会使目标处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","「風の守り」の持続期間中、対象がスーパーアーマー状態になる"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“风愈之护”还会使目标在持续期间内处于霸体状态"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「風の守り」の持続期間中、対象がスーパーアーマー状態になる"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“风链”释放次数增加到5次，风链传导伤害时额外造成传导伤害量20%的生命削减效果。每次风链断裂时，还会对造成伤害最高的友军施加4.5秒的“风愈之护”效果，若该友军身上已有该效果，则使其持续时间延长4.5秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「風繋ぎ」の発動回数が5回にUPし、風の鎖がダメージを伝導する時、追加で伝導ダメージ量×20%のHP上限減少効果を与える。風の鎖が切れるたびに、与ダメージが最も高い味方に4.5秒間の「風の守り」を付与。対象の味方に既に「風の守り」が付与されている場合、その持続時間が4.5秒延長される"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","聆风手杖"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","風奏の杖"]]}